<title>UK: Matthew Clark appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>Matthew Clark appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British cider maker Matthew Clark Plc on Friday said Graham Wilson had been appointed non-executive chairman with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The appointment of Wilson, managing director of United News &amp; Media Plc from 1991 to 1996, allows Michael Garner to step down as acting-chairman -- a position he has filled since the death of previous chairman Michael Cottrell last October. Garner remains on the board.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
